<p>
  Hi, <%= recipient_name %>!
</p>

<p>
  Great news! We have accepted your entry for inclusion in Infra Finder.
</p>

<% if invited? %>
  <p>
    In a few minutes, you will also receive an e-mail invitation to our editor interface,
    where you can make updates or adjustments to any of the information that you see in your entry.
    Please create your password within the next couple of days, as the link may expire.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    You should be able to edit your entry with your existing account credentials
    on this email address.
  </p>
<% end %>

<ul>
  <li>
    Once you have created your password, you will be able to edit your entry
    <%= link_to "here", admin_solution_url(solution) %>.
  </li>

  <li>
    Once the solution has been published, you will be able to see it publicly
    <%= link_to "here", solution_url(solution) %>.
  </li>
</ul>

<p>
  This email will also include detailed instructions
  to guide you through the process of editing the entry;
  these instructions are also available in our
  <%= link_to "Infra Finder documentation", "https://hackmd.io/urgLHvkZRraXhVeoHYb-6g" %>.
</p>

<p>
  We have also created a <%= link_to "communications pack", "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TPszmNLAVIf_Ob1rqOsrV3i0PNteTOzPE5bE2K8vqd0/edit?tab=t.0" %>
  for your entry in Infra Finder.
  This pack contains suggested text for social media
  and newsletters, as well as (by popular request)
  a template for creating an Infra Finder icon for
  your website if you'd like.
</p>

<p>
  Thank you again for participating in Infra Finder!
  Please reach out at any time if you have questions or comments.
</p>
